  "implementation": [
    "App-only RetentionBudget construction admits exact Mutex<Accounting> bytes and one root before Arc allocation. Its permanent used baseline survives every counter alias without storing a reservation back to itself. Generic new/with_limits keep their zero baseline.",
    "App-only gate construction admits concrete GateStorage bytes/root before Arc allocation. Existing state precedes its guard; controls drop before reservation release. Clones and real RunLease preserve its charge after host destruction. Every dispatch transition remains unchanged.",
    "Sessions Arc retains its exact enclosing layout minus two already charged inline readiness Retained layouts. Its own guard drops after actual Sessions shutdown/data. The idle host total is the three complete pointees, three roots and zero ordered entries, without readiness double counting.",
    "Existing checked resource addition is reused at crate-internal visibility for audited test aggregates. No duplicate arithmetic, scientific implementation or public simulation API is added.",
    "Thirty-two final-drop fixtures and concrete intermediate aliases now retain only the actual Accounting baseline plus their original payload owners after host disposal. Two positive-payload assertions compare against counter bytes, preserving their leak/alias meaning. Generic zero-baseline cases and every scientific assertion remain."
  ],
